 "script": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "A second cyclone in one week hit India's east coast. What did it cost?"
  },
  {
   "id": "f1",
   "text": "Cyclone Murasu crossed the Andhra Pradesh coast near Ongole early on November third, says India's weather department. Sustained winds were up to one hundred ten kilometers an hour, with gusts to one hundred twenty. Cyclone Arnab had struck the same coast a week earlier."
  },
  {
   "id": "f2",
   "text": "Officials now report eight deaths. Five were in Bapatla district, two in Guntur and one in Palnadu, according to a news agency report. Authorities moved thousands of people out of low-lying areas before landfall."
  },
  {
   "id": "f3",
   "text": "A preliminary assessment puts the damage at one thousand nine hundred eighteen crore rupees. Reports on crop losses differ, so the final figure is not yet clear. Chief Minister Chandrababu Naidu planned to visit affected areas on Friday."
  },
  {
   "id": "cta",
   "text": "Will another cyclone hit India's east coast this month? Yes or no?"
  }
 ],
